.TH QFW-DASHBOARD-DISABLE 8 "September 2026" "QFw 0.1" "Administration"
.SH NAME
qfw-dashboard-disable \- stop or purge the optional cluster dashboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qfw-dashboard-disable
.RI [ --purge ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stops the dashboard service while preserving its virtual environment and
state. With --purge, removes only generated dashboard installation, runtime,
and state directories beneath dashboard. Cluster and QFw service state are
never changed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qfw-dashboard-enable (8),
.BR qfw-dashboard-service (8)
